        {
            "block_label": "display_formula",
            "block_content": " $$ w_{q}=\\arg\\min_{w_{q}}\\frac{\\left(\\mathrm{quant}(w_{q})-w_{q}\\right)^{2}}{\\left[\\mathbf{H}_{F}^{-1}\\right]_{qq}},\\quad\\delta_{F}=-\\frac{w_{q}-\\mathrm{quant}(w_{q})}{\\left[\\mathbf{H}_{F}^{-1}\\right]_{qq}}\\cdot\\left(\\mathbf{H}_{F}^{-1}\\right)_{:,q}. $$ ",
