            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Figure 2: GPTQ quantization procedure. Blocks of consecutive columns (bolded) are quantized at a given step, using the inverse Hessian information stored in the Cholesky decomposition, and the remaining weights (blue) are updated at the end of the step. The quantization procedure is applied recursively inside each block: the white middle column is currently being quantized.</div>\n",
